%% Source basis: Intel MCS-51 User's Manual, classic 8051 vector map [2]
flowchart TB
    R[Program memory vector region]
    R --> V0[Reset\n0000H]
    R --> V1[External Interrupt 0\nIE0\n0003H]
    R --> V2[Timer 0 overflow\nTF0\n000BH]
    R --> V3[External Interrupt 1\nIE1\n0013H]
    R --> V4[Timer 1 overflow\nTF1\n001BH]
    R --> V5[Serial\nRI or TI\n0023H]
    V1 --> J1[short vector jump\nไปยัง ISR จริง]
    V2 --> J2[short vector jump\nไปยัง ISR จริง]
    V3 --> J3[short vector jump\nไปยัง ISR จริง]
    V4 --> J4[short vector jump\nไปยัง ISR จริง]
    V5 --> J5[short vector jump\nไปยัง ISR จริง]
